  26:     Rule
  27:     - Split the input into lattice cells using the full separator rows and columns.
  28:     - Keep the cells whose full interior is one color, crop to their occupied rectangle, and output those colors.
  29: 
  30:     Key insight
  31:     - The periodic pattern is noise; only completely solid lattice cells encode the reduced output grid.
